# shadcn/ui Component Rules

**CORE PRINCIPLE**: Use shadcn/ui components for ALL interactive UI controls. Use standard HTML for structural layout.

## 🎯 COMPONENT CLASSIFICATION

### ✅ STRUCTURAL HTML (Layout) - ALWAYS ALLOWED:
**Purpose**: Page structure, content organization, semantic markup
- **Container Elements**: `<div>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<header>`, `<footer>`, `<main>`, `<aside>`
- **Layout Elements**: `<nav>`, `<ul>`, `<ol>`, `<li>`, `<p>`, `<span>`, `<h1-h6>`
- **Semantic Elements**: `<figure>`, `<figcaption>`, `<time>`, `<address>`, `<blockquote>`
- **Styling**: Tailwind utility classes for layout (flexbox, grid, spacing, sizing)

### ✅ SHADCN/UI COMPONENTS (Interactive Controls) - MANDATORY:
**Purpose**: User interaction, form controls, complex UI behavior
- **Form Controls**: Button, Input, Checkbox, Select, Textarea, Switch, RadioGroup
- **Interactive Elements**: Dialog, DropdownMenu, Popover, Tooltip, Sheet, Tabs
- **Data Display**: Table, DataTable, Card (when interactive), Badge (when clickable)
- **Feedback**: Alert, Toast, Progress, Loading states

### ❌ FORBIDDEN COMBINATIONS:
- Custom interactive components (custom buttons, inputs, forms)
- Third-party UI libraries for any interactive elements
- Inline styles or custom CSS classes on any elements
- HTML form elements (`<button>`, `<input>`, `<select>`) without shadcn/ui wrappers

## 🔧 INTEGRATION RULES

### 1. AUTHENTICATION COMPONENTS:
**Clerk Integration**: Clerk provides authentication logic, shadcn/ui provides visual interface

#### Clerk Authentication Patterns:
```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"
import { SignInButton, SignUpButton } from "@clerk/nextjs"

// ✅ CORRECT - Clerk behavior + shadcn/ui styling
<div className="flex gap-4">
  <SignInButton mode="modal">
    <Button variant="default">Sign In</Button>
  </SignInButton>
  
  <SignUpButton mode="modal">
    <Button variant="outline">Sign Up</Button>
  </SignUpButton>
</div>
```

#### User Menu Pattern:
```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"
import { DropdownMenu, DropdownMenuContent, DropdownMenuItem, DropdownMenuTrigger } from "@/components/ui/dropdown-menu"
import { Avatar, AvatarFallback, AvatarImage } from "@/components/ui/avatar"
import { useUser, SignOutButton } from "@clerk/nextjs"

function UserMenu() {
  const { user } = useUser()
  
  return (
    <DropdownMenu>
      <DropdownMenuTrigger asChild>
        <Button variant="ghost" className="h-8 w-8 rounded-full">
          <Avatar className="h-8 w-8">
            <AvatarImage src={user?.imageUrl} />
            <AvatarFallback>{user?.firstName?.[0]}</AvatarFallback>
          </Avatar>
        </Button>
      </DropdownMenuTrigger>
      <DropdownMenuContent align="end">
        <DropdownMenuItem>Profile</DropdownMenuItem>
        <SignOutButton>
          <DropdownMenuItem>Sign out</DropdownMenuItem>
        </SignOutButton>
      </DropdownMenuContent>
    </DropdownMenu>
  )
}
```

### 2. LAYOUT + INTERACTIVE COMBINATION:
**Pattern**: Structural HTML for layout + shadcn/ui for interactive elements

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Layout structure + interactive components
<div className="min-h-screen bg-background">
  <header className="border-b">
    <nav className="container mx-auto px-4 py-3">
      <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
        <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold">FlashCard App</h1>
        <UserMenu /> {/* shadcn/ui component */}
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>
  
  <main className="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <section className="mb-8">
      <h2 className="text-xl mb-4">Your Decks</h2>
      <div className="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {/* shadcn/ui Card components for interactive content */}
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
```

