## ❌ FORBIDDEN PATTERNS

### 1. Custom Interactive Components:
```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN - Custom interactive elements
const CustomButton = ({ children, onClick }) => (
  <div onClick={onClick} className="cursor-pointer bg-blue-500 p-2">
    {children}
  </div>
)

const MyInput = ({ value, onChange }) => (
  <input className="custom-input" value={value} onChange={onChange} />
)
```

### 2. Direct HTML Interactive Elements:
```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN - Raw HTML interactive elements
<button onClick={handleClick}>Click me</button>
<input type="text" onChange={handleChange} />
<select onChange={handleSelect}>...</select>
<form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>...</form>
```

### 3. Inline Styles on Any Element:
```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN - Inline styles (breaks design system)
<div style={{ padding: "10px", color: "red" }}>Content</div>
<Button style={{ backgroundColor: "purple" }}>Styled Button</Button>
```

### 4. Standalone Clerk Visual Components:
```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN - Clerk's default UI styling
<SignInButton />          {/* Use with shadcn/ui Button inside */}
<UserButton />           {/* Create custom UserMenu instead */}
<SignIn />               {/* Use mode="modal" with shadcn/ui */}
<UserProfile />          {/* Use mode="modal" with shadcn/ui */}
```

### 5. Third-party UI Libraries:
```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN - Other UI component libraries
import { Button } from "react-bootstrap"
import { TextField } from "@mui/material"
import { Button } from "antd"
```

