        </Button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </Form>
</div>
```

## 📋 COMPONENT DECISION TREE

### Is it interactive or does it need user input?
- **YES** → Use shadcn/ui component (Button, Input, Select, etc.)
- **NO** → Use HTML element with Tailwind classes for layout

### Examples by Category:

#### ✅ Use HTML + Tailwind (Layout/Structure):
- **Page structure**: `<div>`, `<section>`, `<header>`, `<main>`, `<footer>`
- **Content organization**: `<article>`, `<aside>`, `<nav>`
- **Text elements**: `<h1-h6>`, `<p>`, `<span>`, `<ul>`, `<li>`
- **Layout containers**: `<div className="flex">`, `<div className="grid">`

#### ✅ Use shadcn/ui (Interactive Elements):
- **User actions**: Button, DropdownMenu, Dialog, Sheet
- **Form controls**: Input, Select, Checkbox, RadioGroup, Switch, Textarea
- **Data display**: Table, DataTable, Card (with actions), Badge (clickable)
- **Feedback**: Alert, Toast, Progress, Loading states

## 🎯 SHADCN/UI COMPONENT REFERENCE

**Interactive Components by Purpose:**
- **Forms**: Button, Input, Label, Checkbox, Select, Textarea, Form, Switch, RadioGroup
- **Navigation**: DropdownMenu, NavigationMenu, Breadcrumb
- **Overlays**: Dialog, Popover, Tooltip, Sheet, HoverCard
- **Data**: Table, DataTable, Card (interactive), Badge (clickable)
- **Feedback**: Alert, Toast, Progress, Skeleton

**Documentation**: [shadcn/ui Components](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components)

## 🔍 ENFORCEMENT & VALIDATION

### Development Guidelines:
1. **Interactive elements** without shadcn/ui → Replace immediately
2. **Layout elements** with custom styling → Use Tailwind utilities instead
3. **Mixed approaches** → Separate layout (HTML) from interaction (shadcn/ui)

### Code Review Checklist:
- [ ] No custom interactive components
- [ ] No raw HTML form elements (`<button>`, `<input>`, `<select>`)
- [ ] No inline styles on any elements
- [ ] Structural HTML uses semantic elements and Tailwind classes
- [ ] Interactive elements use appropriate shadcn/ui components
- [ ] Dark mode web page, no dark colored text on dark backgrounds (and vice versa)